        "first_text": "GENERAL THETA FOUNDATIONS I:\nACQUIRED GEOMETRY AND CAUSAL RESOURCE TRANSFER\nQIAN QI\nAbstract. We study the positive memory required to reproduce complete causal response laws.\nFor every finite-group target, closed convex constraints on all command words admit a permutation\nrealization at no greater memory cost. This reduces optimal uniform approximation over words of\nunbounded length to an attained finite optimization and gives robust multiplicity lower bounds.\nA sharp simultaneous-positivity in",
